OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 24 MAR
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GA mixtape bursting with classical
OL,6,     Gfavourites and lesser-known gems,
OL,7,     Gwith music by composers from
OL,8,     GChopin and Beethoven to Caroline
OL,9,     GShaw and Samuel Coleridge-Taylor.
OL,10,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,11,     GPatricia Kopatchinskaja plays
OL,12,     GBerg's Violin Concerto with the
OL,13,     GLondon Symphony Orchestra under
OL,14,     Gconductor Gianandrea Noseda, with
OL,15,     GRachmaninoff's 1st Symphony also
OL,16,     Gon the programme.
OL,17,G2145FThe Essay: Erland Cooper's Cities
OL,18,     Fof the Imagination
OL,19,     GErland journeys deep into the
OL,20,     Gheart of the Sahara's Great Sand
OL,21,     GSea to uncover the mystery of
OL,22,     GZerzura.
